               <xs:documentation source="ddex:Definition">A Composite containing details of a Type of Version given by the releasing party to characterise and differentiate one RecordingComponent from another with identical or similar Title metadata. VersionTypes may be used for disambiguating a RecordingComponent that has been derived from another RecordingComponent by using the value EditedVersion. EditedVersion value is often combined with another VersionType such as RadioVersion.</xs:documentation>
